Introduction
----------------------------------------------

This package (living in $VALOR_FMWK/scripts/data_distribution/) provides a set of scripts and 
configuration files, for the efficient distribution of VALOR analysis data files.

An arbitrary number of VALOR data resources can exist concurrently, each serving different data products.
The current list of data archives can be found in [THIS_PACKAGE]/config/resources/
Data from each resource are accessed either via wget (http) or scp.

Each data archive can serve a number of data products. The full list of currated VALOR data products,
their locations, and other related information can be found in [THIS_PACKAGE]/config/data_resources/

Upon preparing (or updating) a data product, the data curator needs to run the `valor_data-generate_checksums'
script to generate MD5 checksums for all files in the data products. Using the generated checksums, remote 
users can fetch only new files and the files that have been updated since the last fetch.

To fetch a single data product, a remote user needs to run the `valor_data-fetch' script.

To fetch a labelled set of related data products, a remote user needs to run the `valor_data-fetch_set' script.

See the header of each script for detailed usage instructions.


Directory structure of each VALOR data archive
----------------------------------------------

                              |------ data product qualifiers -------|
                              |                                      |
<archive base>                 <major>       <minor>       <revision>
                                  |             |              |
                                  |             |              |
                                 \|/           \|/            \|/
 /some/path/
    |--------- checksums/
    |
    |--------- data/
                 |-------------- t2k/
                 |                |---------- toys
                 |                |             |
                 |                |             |----------- 2017a/
                 |                |                            |------- ... more directories and data files                    
                 |                |---------- oa_base
                 |                              |----------- 2017a/
                 |                                             |--------- ... more directories and data files
                 |-------------- dune/
                                  |---------- ndfit/
                                  |             |---------- 2016c/
                                  |             |              |-------- ... more directories and data files
                                  |             |
                                  |             |---------- 2017a/
                                  |                            |-------- ... more directories and data files
                                  |---------- fdfit/
                                                |---------- 2016c/
                                                |              |-------- ... more directories and data files
                                                |
                                                |---------- 2017a/
                                                               |-------- ... more directories and data files
